# Auto-activate the devenv shell whenever you enter this directory (interactive
# shells via the direnv bash hook, and editors through the direnv extension).
#
# `use devenv` enters the shell defined in devenv.nix, which sets `dotenv.enable
# = true` — so the git-ignored .env (see .env.example) is loaded automatically
# and secrets like GH_TOKEN land in the environment for tooling such as the
# GitHub MCP server.
eval "$(devenv direnvrc)"

use devenv
